# Both original instantiated SAM entries are RawStreamItem: retain their entry
# CHECKCAST, including Objects::nonNull. A typed carrier can feed the raw stream.
# TestRawStreamLambdaCastIsLoadBearing independently pins bootstrap and def-use.
+/Function<RawStreamItem, Object> \w+ = \(l0\) ->/
+.filter((Predicate)(((Predicate<RawStreamItem>)(Objects::nonNull))))
+/\.map\(\(Function\)\(\w+\)\)/
+return l0.val();
-.map((RawStreamItem l0) ->
